### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  SUPPLIQ AI Service — Endpoint Reference
###  VS Code: install "REST Client" extension, then click
###  "Send Request" above any block to see the response inline.
###
###  Service must be running:
###    cd ai && python -m uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
###
###  Interactive Swagger UI (browser):
###    http://localhost:8000/docs
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@host   = http://localhost:8000
@org_id = seed-org-meridian


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  CORE
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Root — service info
GET {{host}}/

###

### Health — db_connected + claude_configured
GET {{host}}/health


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  FORECASTING
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Demand forecast — 30 days, all items & branches
POST {{host}}/forecast/demand
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organization_id": "{{org_id}}",
  "horizon_days": 30
}

###

### Demand forecast — 60 days, all items & branches
POST {{host}}/forecast/demand
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organization_id": "{{org_id}}",
  "horizon_days": 60
}

###

### Demand forecast — 90 days, single item (replace item_id)
POST {{host}}/forecast/demand
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organization_id": "{{org_id}}",
  "horizon_days": 90,
  "item_id": null,
  "branch_id": null
}

###

### Cash flow forecast — 30-day projection with Claude commentary
GET {{host}}/forecast/cash-flow/{{org_id}}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  MARKET INTELLIGENCE
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Supply chain news — 5 articles, scored & summarised by Claude
GET {{host}}/intelligence/news?organization_id={{org_id}}&limit=5

###

### Supply chain news — 20 articles (max useful set)
GET {{host}}/intelligence/news?organization_id={{org_id}}&limit=20

###

### Market prices & FX rates (FX pairs derived from org currency)
GET {{host}}/intelligence/market-prices/{{org_id}}

###

### Supplier reliability scores — all suppliers, worst first
GET {{host}}/intelligence/supplier-scores/{{org_id}}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  OPTIMIZATION
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Reorder recommendations — critical stockouts first
###   Each recommendation includes Claude-generated reasoning,
###   days until stockout, EOQ suggested order quantity, and priority.
GET {{host}}/optimize/reorder/{{org_id}}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  ANOMALY DETECTION
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### All anomalies — sales spikes/drops, stock discrepancies, expense outliers
###   Sorted: critical → warning → info
GET {{host}}/anomalies/{{org_id}}
